    <Folder><name>Facilities</name>
      <Placemark><name>I-64 Welcome Center East</name><styleUrl>#public</styleUrl><description>EB MM 10.06. Public - state | Access: EB only | Spaces: Public - WVDOT Rest Areas GIS layer: 22 | Private - TruckStopsAndServices.com (TSS): 25 | Satellite count (Esri World Imagery dated 2024-10-19): 23 spots counted along parking rows (8 occupied, 15 empty on the image) | Sources differ: 22 to 25 | Status: Open | Cost: Free; no reservations | Restrooms: Yes | Showers: No | 24/7 staff: Info desk 8am-6pm; grounds 24/7 | Lighting: Unknown | Separate truck and passenger parking; vending; WiFi; picnic; overnight truck parking permitted in designated big-vehicle areas</description><Point><coordinates>-82.4224,38.3923,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Go-Mart #59 Huntington</name><styleUrl>#private</styleUrl><description>Exit 15 (US 60). Private - GoMart | Access: Both via exit | Spaces: Public - WVDOT Rest Areas GIS layer: 38 | Private - AllStays: 25; FindFuelStops: 38; TruckStopsAndServices.com (TSS): 38 | Satellite count (Esri World Imagery dated 2024-10-19): 27 spots counted along parking rows (22 occupied, 5 empty on the image) | Sources differ: 25 to 38 | Status: Open | Cost: Free; no reservations | Restrooms: Yes | Showers: No | 24/7 staff: Yes 24/7 | Lighting: Yes (lighted; paved) | Paved lot at 4901 US 60; deli; ATM; trailer drop; hazmat parking listed; imagery July 2026: ~18-20 trucks/trailers in two rows; some appear to be drop-lot storage</description><Point><coordinates>-82.3509,38.4124,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Hurricane Rest Area East</name><styleUrl>#public</styleUrl><description>EB MM 35.14. Public - state | Access: EB only | Spaces: Public - WVDOT Rest Areas GIS layer: 26 | Private - TruckStopsAndServices.com (TSS): 13 | Satellite count (Esri World Imagery dated 2025-03-11): 9 spots counted along parking rows (3 occupied, 6 empty on the image) | Sources differ: 9 to 26 | Status: Open | Cost: Free; no reservations | Restrooms: Yes | Showers: No | 24/7 staff: No (unstaffed; open 24/7) | Lighting: Unknown | Separate truck/car parking; RV dump; RVs park with trucks; overnight allowed; NOTE imagery shows WB side has the more substantial truck rows despite reviews calling EB larger; 8 trucks present at July 2026 count</description><Point><coordinates>-81.9986,38.4492,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Hurricane Rest Area West</name><styleUrl>#public</styleUrl><description>WB MM 35.05. Public - state | Access: WB only | Spaces: Public - WVDOT Rest Areas GIS layer: 19 | Private - TruckStopsAndServices.com (TSS): 13 | Satellite count (Esri World Imagery dated 2025-03-11): 20 spots counted along parking rows (9 occupied, 11 empty on the image) | Sources differ: 13 to 20 | Status: Open | Cost: Free; no reservations | Restrooms: Yes | Showers: No | 24/7 staff: No (unstaffed; open 24/7) | Lighting: Unknown | Older building than EB side but imagery shows more substantial angled truck rows behind car lot; 10 trucks + 1 bus present at July 2026 count; picnic; limited vending</description><Point><coordinates>-82.0001,38.4491,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>I-64 Weigh Station EB (Hurricane)</name><styleUrl>#uncertain</styleUrl><description>EB MM ~37.5 (between Hurricane rest areas MM 35 and Exit 39). Public - state | Access: EB only | Spaces: Satellite count (Esri World Imagery dated 2025-03-11): 3 spots counted along parking rows (0 occupied, 3 empty on the image) | Single source: 3 | Status: Unverified (listed as an active I-64 EB scale; operating hours not confirmed) | Cost: Free; no reservations | Restrooms: Unknown | Showers: No | 24/7 staff: Unknown (staffed only when scale is open) | Lighting: Unknown | Parking Study A41. Located by imagery: EB scale house on south side of I-64 ~1.9 mi east of the Hurricane rest areas; coopsareopen.com lists 'Hurricane (Charleston) I-64 EB MM 37.5' (page dated 2012). Whether trucks may park here outside inspection (overnight) is NOT established - needs field verification / WV PSC enforcement confirmation before counting it as parking.</description><Point><coordinates>-81.9545,38.4572,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>I-64 Weigh Station WB (Hurricane)</name><styleUrl>#uncertain</styleUrl><description>WB MM ~37.5 (between Exit 39 and Hurricane rest areas MM 35). Public - state | Access: WB only | Spaces: Satellite count (Esri World Imagery dated 2025-03-11): up to 11 (area-based maximum, not a count) | No published count found | Status: Unverified (listed as an active I-64 WB scale; operating hours not confirmed) | Cost: Free; no reservations | Restrooms: Unknown | Showers: No | 24/7 staff: Unknown (staffed only when scale is open) | Lighting: Unknown | Parking Study A42. Located by imagery: WB scale house on north side of I-64 opposite the EB scale; coopsareopen.com lists 'Hurricane (Charleston) I-64 WB MM 37.5' (page dated 2012). Trucks were parked on the apron at image time, but whether overnight parking is permitted is NOT established - needs field verification.</description><Point><coordinates>-81.9577,38.4586,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>TA Hurricane #149 (Teays Valley)</name><styleUrl>#private</styleUrl><description>Exit 39 (WV 34); MM 38.78. Private - TA | Access: Both via exit | Spaces: Public - WVDOT Rest Areas GIS layer: 78 | Private - TA official site: 76 truck parking spaces (Reserve-It! paid spaces offered; reserved count not published); TruckStopsAndServices.com (TSS): 76 (30 reserved) (30 paid) | Satellite count (Esri World Imagery dated 2025-03-11): 37 spots counted along parking rows (31 occupied, 6 empty on the image) | Sources differ: 37 to 78 | Status: Open | Cost: Free general; paid Reserve-It spots | Restrooms: Yes | Showers: Yes (7 incl 1 ADA) | 24/7 staff: Yes 24/7 | Lighting: Yes (lighted; paved) | 4195 State Route 34; CAT scale; 5 service bays; laundry; restaurant; WVDOT 2023 profile: typically very congested</description><Point><coordinates>-81.9354,38.4538,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Go-Mart #43 Teays Valley</name><styleUrl>#private</styleUrl><description>Exit 39 (WV 34); MM 38.67. Private - GoMart | Access: Both via exit | Spaces: Public - WVDOT Rest Areas GIS layer: 15 | Private - AllStays: 15; TruckStopsAndServices.com (TSS): 20 | Sources differ: 15 to 20 | Status: Open | Cost: Free; no reservations | Restrooms: Yes | Showers: No | 24/7 staff: Yes 24/7 | Lighting: Yes (lighted; paved) | 4206 SR 34 across from TA; deli/grill; truckers lounge; ATM; trailer drop; small lot</description><Point><coordinates>-81.9378,38.4538,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Pilot Travel Center #243 Nitro</name><styleUrl>#private</styleUrl><description>Exit 45 (WV 25). Private - Pilot | Access: Both via exit | Spaces: Public - WVDOT Rest Areas GIS layer: 60 | Private - Pilot official site: 50 truck parking spaces (Prime reserved parking offered; reserved count not shown); TruckStopsAndServices.com (TSS): 60 (17 reserved) (17 paid) | Satellite count (Esri World Imagery dated 2025-03-11): 26 spots counted along parking rows (13 occupied, 13 empty on the image) | Sources differ: 26 to 60 | Status: Open | Cost: Free general; 17 paid Prime Parking spots | Restrooms: Yes | Showers: Yes (5-6) | 24/7 staff: Yes 24/7 | Lighting: Yes (lighted; paved) | 4304 1st Ave Nitro; Arby's; CAT scale; laundry; reefer plug-ins; WVDOT 2023 profile: typically very congested</description><Point><coordinates>-81.8307,38.4441,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>I-64 EB Brake Check Area (Exit 133 Bragg)</name><styleUrl>#uncertain</styleUrl><description>Exit 133 (Pluto Rd / Bragg); top of EB Sandstone Mountain descent. Public - state | Access: EB only | Spaces: Satellite count (Esri World Imagery dated 2023-02-18): up to 9 (area-based maximum, not a count) | No published count found | Status: Unverified (2000 trade press: mandatory EB truck pull-off built at Bragg exit; current signage/use not confirmed) | Cost: Free; no reservations | Restrooms: No | Showers: No | 24/7 staff: No | Lighting: Unknown | Parking Study A23. Brake-check pull-off for the 7% / ~5 mi EB descent of Sandstone Mountain. Located by imagery in the SE quadrant of the Exit 133 interchange. Designed for short equipment checks, not overnight parking - confirm whether parking is tolerated before counting capacity.</description><Point><coordinates>-80.9867,37.7675,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Sandstone Visitor Center (NPS)</name><styleUrl>#public</styleUrl><description>Exit 139 (WV 20). Public - federal (NPS) | Access: Both via exit | Spaces: Public - National Park Service: 0 semi-designated (2+ RV/bus spots) | Single source: 0 | Status: Open (day hours only) | Cost: Free day-use | Restrooms: Yes | Showers: No | 24/7 staff: No (day hours only) | Lighting: Unknown | NOT an overnight truck facility; included to document absence of parking on this segment</description><Point><coordinates>-80.8978,37.7833,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
