      <Placemark><name>Alta Truck Plaza / Alta Station (Mobil)</name><styleUrl>#private</styleUrl><description>Exit 161 (WV 12); MM 161.5. Private - independent (Mobil) | Access: Both (field-verified) | Spaces: Public - Study team field count: 12 marked + 6-8 on unmarked gravel; WVDOT Rest Areas GIS layer: 10 | Private - TruckStopsAndServices.com (TSS): 13 | Sources differ: 10 to 13 | Status: Open (field-verified; one directory wrongly lists closed) | Cost: Free; no reservations | Restrooms: Yes | Showers: Unknown | 24/7 staff: No (6am-9pm Mon-Sat; 7am-9pm Sun) | Lighting: Yes (lighted; paved) | 13194 Alta Dr; deli; restaurant; trucker lounge; ATM; only truck stop on I-64 between Nitro Exit 45 and VA line outside the Turnpike; imagery confirms station + large irregular gravel pad extending ~150m south of pumps (fits 6-10 trucks); 5-7 trucks visible</description><Point><coordinates>-80.5547,37.8654,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Walmart Supercenter Lewisburg</name><styleUrl>#private</styleUrl><description>Exit 169 (US 219). Private - Walmart | Access: Both via exit | Spaces: Private - FindFuelStops / Walmart store page: no designated truck spaces | Single source: 0 | Status: Open | Cost: Free at store discretion | Restrooms: Yes (store hours) | Showers: No | 24/7 staff: No | Lighting: Unknown | Informal overnight big-rig parking typical of Walmart lots; subject to store policy; WVDOT 2023 profile notes Walmart spillover is common statewide</description><Point><coordinates>-80.4293,37.8119,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>I-64 Welcome Center West</name><styleUrl>#public</styleUrl><description>WB MM 178.71. Public - state | Access: WB only | Spaces: Public - WVDOT Rest Areas GIS layer: 6 | Private - TruckStopsAndServices.com (TSS): 10 | Satellite count (Esri World Imagery dated 2023-02-18): 9 spots counted along parking rows (1 occupied, 8 empty on the image) | Sources differ: 6 to 10 | Status: Open | Cost: Free; no reservations | Restrooms: Yes | Showers: No | 24/7 staff: Info desk 8am-6pm; grounds 24/7 | Lighting: Unknown | First WB facility from VA; imagery confirms tight geometry: thin elongated shelf between WB lanes and hillside; single long aisle ~200m; no room to expand laterally; 1 truck visible</description><Point><coordinates>-80.3005,37.7857,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
