      <Placemark><name>GoMart Truck Stop Beckley (Harper Rd)</name><styleUrl>#private</styleUrl><description>Exit 44 (Harper Rd). Private - GoMart | Access: Both (field-verified: access and facilities both directions) | Spaces: Public - Study team field count: 28 dedicated truck spots; WVDOT Rest Areas GIS layer: 20; Study corridor sketch (data.png): 25? | Private - AllStays: 18 (outdated); TruckStopsAndServices.com (TSS): 20 | Satellite count (Esri World Imagery dated 2023-02-18): 26 spots counted along parking rows (11 occupied, 15 empty on the image) | Sources differ: 18 to 28 | Status: Open 24hr | Cost: Free; no reservations | Restrooms: Yes | Showers: Unknown | 24/7 staff: Yes 24hr | Lighting: Yes (24/7 facility) | 2100 Harper Rd; deli/restaurant; ATM; TCH/Fuelman; just west of interchange; imagery: separate diesel canopy behind store; ~10-12 marked slots along north tree line + wide open rear apron (28 total plausible incl apron); 9-10 trucks visible</description><Point><coordinates>-81.2186,37.7964,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Beckley Travel Plaza</name><styleUrl>#public</styleUrl><description>MM 45.3 at Exit 45. Public - state (Parkways Authority) | Access: Both via Exit 45 ramps (physically SB side) | Spaces: Public - WVDOT Rest Areas GIS layer: 65 (before the expansion); WV Parkways Authority (as reported in trade press): 165 (130 pre-rebuild + 35 added); Study corridor sketch (data.png): 165 | Private - TruckStopsAndServices.com (TSS): 125 | Satellite count (Esri World Imagery dated 2023-02-18): 169 spots counted along parking rows (40 occupied, 129 empty on the image) | Sources differ: 65 to 169 | Status: Open (rebuilt; reopened Dec 30 2024) | Cost: Free; no reservations | Restrooms: Yes | Showers: No | 24/7 staff: Yes (24/7 Mountain State Market) | Lighting: Yes (24/7 facility) | Largest truck lot on corridor; Starbucks; Wendy's; Popeye's; 8 EV fast chargers; Tamarack shares interchange but is NOT a separate truck lot; Tamarack lower lot allows free overnight truck/RV parking if driver notifies front desk; NOTE satellite imagery predates rebuild completion (shows old plaza + freshly striped new grid lot; ~50 trucks visible) - 165 figure is from Parkways press not countable in current imagery</description><Point><coordinates>-81.2129,37.8024,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Burnwell Rest Area (MM 69)</name><styleUrl>#public</styleUrl><description>SB MM 69.32 (I-64 EB). Public - state (Parkways) | Access: SB only | Spaces: Public - WVDOT Rest Areas GIS layer: 18 | Private - TruckStopsAndServices.com (TSS): 15 | Satellite count (Esri World Imagery dated 2020-11-20): 8 spots counted along parking rows (3 occupied, 5 empty on the image) | Sources differ: 8 to 18 | Status: Open | Cost: Free | Restrooms: Yes (restrooms 24/7) | Showers: No | 24/7 staff: Building staffed 8:30am-6:30pm; 24hr vending | Lighting: Unknown | Only public stop on 27-mile SB gap between Morton and Beckley; vending; WiFi; ATM</description><Point><coordinates>-81.3813,38.0686,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Morton Travel Plaza</name><styleUrl>#public</styleUrl><description>NB MM 72.13 (I-64 WB); Cabin Creek. Public - state (Parkways Authority) | Access: NB only | Spaces: Public - WVDOT Rest Areas GIS layer: 25 (before demolition); WV Parkways Authority: closed for reconstruction ('Coming Soon!'); new count not published | Private - AllStays: 20 (before demolition); TruckStopsAndServices.com (TSS): 33 | Sources differ: 20 to 33 | Status: UNDER CONSTRUCTION - demolished Feb-Mar 2025; $50.3M rebuild; contract completion Oct 31 2026 | Cost: n/a during construction | Restrooms: No (closed) | Showers: No | 24/7 staff: No | Lighting: Unknown | Final phase of Turnpike plaza modernization; no interim truck parking at site; NB trucks must use Beckley MM 45 or GoMart Exit 95; satellite imagery predates demolition (shows old plaza with ~18-20 angled slots and 15-18 trucks - illustrates lost capacity)</description><Point><coordinates>-81.3831,38.1021,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Sheetz Marmet (Exit 89)</name><styleUrl>#private</styleUrl><description>Exit 89 (WV-61/WV-94 Marmet); 10401 MacCorkle Ave. Private - Sheetz | Access: Both via exit | Spaces: Private - Truckers News (pre-opening press, Dec 2024): 19 | Satellite count (Esri World Imagery dated 2025-11-13): 18 spots counted along parking rows (4 occupied, 14 empty on the image) | Sources differ: 18 to 19 | Status: Open (opened Dec 12 2024) | Cost: Free; no reservations (unconfirmed) | Restrooms: Yes | Showers: Unknown | 24/7 staff: Unknown | Lighting: Unknown | Parking Study A09. New truck-capable Sheetz on MacCorkle Ave at Turnpike Exit 89. The 19-space figure predates opening; reconcile against an imagery/field count of the striped truck row before relying on it.</description><Point><coordinates>-81.5625,38.2412,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
